<div class="feature">
	<div class="sticker"><img src="/images/sticker-one-time-use.png" class="one-time-use" /></div>
	<h4>This locker will self-destruct!</h4>
	<p>Store your digital stuff in a locker and after anyone accesses it, the contents disppear! (Or set the number of tries.)</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
    <div class="sticker"><img src="/images/sticker-public-trove.png" class="public-trove" /></div>
	<h4>One solution, everybody wins!</h4>
	<p>Store your digital treasure in a locker and after anyone accesses it, the contents will be available to everyone—great for games!</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
    <div class="sticker"><img src="/images/sticker-device-paired.png" class="device-paired" /></div>
	<h4>Personal storage on your device.</h4>
	<p>Store something in a locker that can only be accessed via QR scan on <i>only the device that created</i> the locker.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
    <div class="sticker"><img src="/images/sticker-passphrase-linked.png" class="passphrase-linked"/></div>
	<h4>Open seasame!</h4>
	<p>Store your digital stuff in a locker and make sure no one can access it without the QR key AND a passphrase.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature">
    <div class="sticker"><img src="/images/sticker-time-lock.png" class="time-lock"/></div>
	<h4>Do not open until Christmas.</h4>
	<p>Store any digital files in a locker and have it only be accessible with a QR key after or before a set time.</p>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
.feature {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  row-gap: 0px; /* Adjust to 0px for zero gap */
  align-content: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0.5rem;
  width: 280px;

  .sticker img {
      display: block; /* Removes the ~4px inline baseline gap under images */
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 100%;
  }

  p {
     line-height: 1.4;
     padding: 0;
     margin: 0; /* Strips default browser margins */
  }

  h4 {
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1rem;
  }
}

.feature:nth-child(1) {
    transform: translateX(-120px);
}
.feature:nth-child(2) {
    transform: translate(120px);
    margin-top: -100px;
}
.feature:nth-child(3) {
    transform: translate(-120px);
    margin-top: -100px;
}
.feature:nth-child(4) {
    transform: translate(120px);
    margin-top: -100px;
}
.feature:nth-child(5) {
    transform: translate(-120px);
    margin-top: -100px;
}

.one-time-use{
    transform: rotate(3deg);
}
.public-trove {
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
}
.device-paired {
    transform: rotate(3deg);
}
.passphrase-linked {
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
}
.time-lock {
    transform: rotate(3deg);
}

@media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .feature:nth-child(1),
    .feature:nth-child(2),
    .feature:nth-child(3),
    .feature:nth-child(4),
    .feature:nth-child(5) {
        transform: none;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }
}
</style>
